{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_008_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a6a582d90000a38bb33569338c1ce9604aa8e17abf199c5e975d7e8cb6c9af0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4078ad91629648e00857f39640f73b86f96bd530a60c3e7a3d404bbafddb2f8e",
      "text": "这是情人节的巧克力？ 给我的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074e04be8cd0f38168d1f19d810d0ae1b4a2f83cf245c57ddf7f35b633580007",
      "text": "其实，关于情人节我并没有什么 美好的回忆……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20a6e3ad95538b29c9b2fee869313b2020b05f6f9b4ffe2ecd8ea040df06e217",
      "text": "……但我从你的巧克力中感受到了真心。 与那些只重表面的礼物不同。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aae8360b4c8edd1da596836abeec5dfeb53425375ce35c2a783d8191c61ff24d",
      "text": "你特意准备的心意， 我不能辜负。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60049256473b0f44b2885580827f3deca6170e839b9b357a0917d97b2990944",
      "text": "这个我就收下了。 非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:840de830e7cab4f4d82de930b057034cffd7927076937086616a80fb25e2099d",
      "text": "这是情人节巧克力？ 你送给我的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad1ff16bfff904abc34cfe1a429f52f16ec936d5340d24adfcbc4a228cbfc250",
      "text": "啊啊，抱歉。其实我并不太喜欢 情人节这个节日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d68be047a6bbb1cb4cc7a36454a086fef03cb7a9b87fcdc12bd8011fa6be0a",
      "text": "我原本觉得，收到那种只装了表面心意的巧克力 也没有什么意义。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:021626579e2d0690a750c314636a17505e1b611149550993e8c9adc24b1a7702",
      "text": "但是，收到你送的巧克力， 我却不可思议地感到很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:422b45486eaef6dfde4967efdc4bd9867656de3ed2051885560b713697478e08",
      "text": "一定是因为在我心中，你已经渐渐成为了 特别的存在吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b6ec346f0960372f925546e8b396e8c02b4dc4ae98c6f716b7dfa2828cc79a",
      "text": "谢谢，这份巧克力 我会珍惜地享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:442cc8efe54cd9bdcc123b1cded0447036921c505f2889f2f17d75b539ad7542",
      "text": "你能喜欢我就很开心了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb8c6282ecb6f318c468b83ceb605e4b943d0e78f6990eccdd10067554c7c2d6",
      "text": "你能这么说再好不过了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d94eb4faa3e222ecdc96bc6f80be78a2c4a853297a9b4c5f49e09c4d1c527e18",
      "text": "啊啊。 白色情人节我一定会准备好回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_008_22:5_01_008_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a8cf0bff495997f48993099f3632c3bd7461dde46bf010d43e15aedde1c050e",
      "text": "该回什么礼好呢…… 我想从现在开始考虑。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
